          "english": "Rainbows present a __(30)__ made up of seven colors in a specific order. In fact, school children in many English-speaking countries are taught to remember the name \"Roy G. Biv\" as an aid for remembering the colors of a rainbow and their order. \"Roy G. Biv\" __(31)__ for: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, and violet. The outer edge of the rainbow arc is red, while the inner edge is violet.",
